            <ArticleTitle>Hockey stick guiding catheter.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>331-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Guiding catheter strategies form an important component of successful PTCA. Selection of appropriate guiding catheters is essential for providing adequate back-up support and visualization. Hockey stick guiding catheters are an excellent choice for performing PTCA of the right coronary artery and for saphenous vein grafts.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
